'''Chroma Heart Wand''' is a [[Chroma Weapons|chroma]] that is obtainable by unboxing the [[2026 Valentine's Box]] for 30 [[Heart Gems]] [[File:Heart Gem.png|25x25px]] or 60 [[Diamonds|Gems]] [[File:Diamond_icon.png|25x25px]] during the [[Valentines Event 2026|2026 Valentine's Day Event]].

== Appearance ==
It has the same appearance as [[Heart Wand]], but with alternating colors.

== Trivia ==
* It is the chroma counterpart of the [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife [[Heart Wand]].
* This is the first unboxable godly from a Valentine's Event
* This, [[Candy]], [[Turkey]], [[BattleAxe]]. [[BattleAxe II]], [[Evergreen]] and [[Bat]] are the only godly "[[knives]]" that do not resemble knives.
